Subject: styles: a foundation entry without the component sheets

What: styles/foundation.css holds the layer order, colors, theme, base, utilities
and animations; styles/index.css is the foundation plus every component sheet, as
before; the Tailwind entry imports the foundation; component sheets are exported
as `@opencode-ai/ui/<name>.css`.
Why: an app loads only the sheets of the components it renders. The Claxedo app
renders none of app-icon, context-menu, hover-card, inline-input, logo, progress,
progress-circle, radio-group, tabs or typewriter, yet loaded all ten sheets.

